ounty"],["ARC or PLC in Wright County","/arc-plc/minnesota/wright-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Wright County came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years for February to March and for October to November, and in 29 of 75 years for June to July. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 161% of normal for June to July and 33% of normal for January to February. Every grid in the table had its driest year in 1976, and grid 30146 was at 53% of normal that year.</p>"}
